Phone Accessories: Selling cases and chargers in markets.
Used Phone Reselling: Buying second-hand and flipping on sites like Jiji.
Event Decor/Planning: Small birthday or anniversary setups.
Phone & Laptop Repair: Requires GH₵1,500 – GH₵4,000 for tools/kiosk.
Mini-Importation: Buying fashion/cosmetics from China/Dubai.
Small Food Stall: Local dishes like waakye or jollof.
Liquid Soap Production: Making and bottling detergents.
Fruit Juice/Smoothie Bar: Local fresh juice production.
Barbering Shop: Basic setup with two chairs.
Hair Braiding/Salon: Home-based or small kiosk.
Graphic Design Agency: Requires a high-performance laptop.
Photography Services: Event-based photography.
Small Scale Pig Farming: Starting with two pigs costs ~GH₵2,000.
Poultry Farming (Layers/Broilers): Small backyard coop.
Clothing Line: Starting with local fabrics like Kente or Batik.
Cleaning Services: Residential and office cleaning.
Bookkeeping Services: For other SMEs.
Pet Grooming: Rapidly growing niche in urban areas. 
